- All text: Serif font (Georgia, Palatino, or similar)
- Box headers: 11-12px bold
- Body text: 9-10px regular
- Annotations: 8-9px italic
- Key results: 10px bold in green

=== DO NOT ===
- No gradients or 3D effects
- No drop shadows
- No clip art, decorative icons, or emoji
- No background patterns or textures
- No curved or diagonal arrows
- Labels must not overflow containers
- Do not use colors outside the Census xdgov palette
- Do not show model logos or vendor branding
